 and lot-to-pen mappings?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Only users with operational access can import source records and change mappings; other users can view them.\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-4\",\n  \"question\": \"Who may change target weights and growth-rate assumptions used for forecasts?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Authorized managers can change the assumptions; other users can view forecasts.\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-5\",\n  \"question\": \"Who may maintain inventory items, record receipts or adjustments, and change the wastage setting?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Authorized inventory users may make these changes; operational users may view inventory and record feeding subject to stock controls.\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-6\",\n  \"question\": \"Who may create, revise, optimize, and approve ration definitions?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Only users with authorized ration-management access may perform these actions; other users may view rations.\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-7\",\n  \"question\": \"How should feed-plan creation or adjustment permissions differ from updating a plan's execution status?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Authorized planners generate or adjust plans; operators may update execution status for their assigned pens.\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"question\": \"Who may add weight measurements to a lot's history?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Only authorized livestock or operations users may add measurements; other users may view them.\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"sentences\" kind=\"restated\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"n\": 1,\n  \"text\": \"Build a responsive feedlot web app with email-and-password sign-in, permission-based navigation and actions, and session-expiration handling that clears protected data and returns users to sign-in.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 2,\n  \"text\": \"Provide authorized users with mock procurement and receiving imports, including record preview, selected-record submission, returned results, repeat-import matching, and allocation-conflict flags; show existing imported records without enabled import actions to users lacking operational access.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 3,\n  \"text\": \"Let authorized users map PO lines to lots and lots to pens, retain and display allocated quantities and pen details, show saved service values, and display save errors while retaining the last saved mappings.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 4,\n  \"text\": \"Display lot forecasts using incoming animal data, yard defaults, and lot-specific overrides, show projected dates as unavailable without positive gain rates, and restrict forecast-assumption editing to authorized managers.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 5,\n  \"text\": \"Display feed inventory items, stock movements, and projections across daily, weekly, monthly, quarterly, semi-annual, and annual horizons, distinguishing actual wastage from delivered-feed consumption; allow authorized inventory users to maintain items, record receipts or adjustments, and change wastage settings.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 6,\n  \"text\": \"Let authorized ration managers create, revise, optimize, and approve ration definitions; display ingredients, proportions, nutrition, and costs; and present the lowest-cost qualifying optimized mix separately from saved rations until explicitly saved.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 7,\n  \"text\": \"Let authorized planners generate or adjust dated pen-level feed plans and display returned plan details and status; flag plans for review when relevant inputs change, preserve saved values until confirmed or regenerated, and show intake variance without rewriting the plan.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 8,\n  \"text\": \"Allow operators assigned to a plan's pen to update execution status, withhold enabled status-update actions from other operators, and display service refusals; show plan-change actions only to authorized planners.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 9,\n  \"text\": \"Let operational users record feeding activity by pen and lot, including per-lot allocations, and display returned variance, cost, energy, inventory consumption, status, and lot-level totals; show stock errors without presenting refused events as saved.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 10,\n  \"text\": \"Let authorized livestock or operations users add lot weight measurements and display time-ordered measurement histories and returned gain information; show histories without enabled add actions to users lacking entry access.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 11,\n  \"text\": \"Display returned lot performance metrics, including days on feed, weight gain, average daily gain, feed consumed, feed conversion ratio, cost of gain, and projected ship date; show unavailable ship dates without positive ADG and refresh displayed values after feeding or weight records change.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 12,\n  \"text\": \"Present explainable, rule-based feeding-adjustment or sale-timing suggestions based on lot weight-gain trends, and leave resulting plan or sale changes to an authorized planner's explicit action.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 13,\n  \"text\": \"Display dashboard measures for yard and lot performance, inventory, feeding, weight, cost, and energy, and let users choose FCR, ADG, or cost of gain to rank best- and worst-performing lots; show returned empty-data states.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 14,\n  \"text\": \"Provide filterable operational reports for inventory, feeding, lot performance, and profitability, answer the specified pen, lot, ration, plan-variance, inventory, and cost-of-gain questions, and export filtered results as CSV.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 15,\n  \"text\": \"Restrict dashboards, reports, and exports to records and profitability fields returned as authorized for the signed-in user's yards and permissions, and remove data from view and subsequent exports when permissions change.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 16,\n  \"text\": \"Provide a feed-to-gain report comparing lot ADG, FCR, and cost of gain, with date-range, breed, sex, and pen filters and permission-aware CSV or PDF exports; indicate when sex filtering is unavailable for records without sex data.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 17,\n  \"text\": \"Provide a filterable lot-profitability list containing only authorized-yard results, hide profitability values when access is unavailable, and export filtered authorized results as CSV.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 18,\n  \"text\": \"Let authorized users load visibly designated sample data, prevent duplicate sample loading, require confirmation before reset or replacement, display returned results, and withhold enabled sample-data management actions from users lacking permission.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 19,\n  \"text\": \"Display returned yard-level active-lot total head, average ADG, average cost of gain, and total feed cost, showing unavailable values for missing source data.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 20,\n  \"text\": \"Provide a delivery overview or presentation page with the proposed solution, architecture diagrams, app demo entry point, prompts used, testing and validation overview, challenges, production-readiness assessment, and go-to-market analysis.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 21,\n  \"text\": \"Ensure every page works at phone, tablet, and desktop widths without horizontal page overflow, with narrow-screen touch targets at least 44 by 44 CSS pixels.\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\nMap the sentences."}